{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the Shadows. Clear the Unknown.</strong><br>Immerse yourself in the boots of a SWAT officer tasked with clearing hostile environments where tension hangs as heavy as the silence. This VR tactical shooter plunges you into tight, atmospheric interiors where every room tells a story\u2014and hides a threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sweep rooms with precision, breach doors, detain suspects, and face unnerving encounters in dimly lit corridors. Your training, instincts, and trigger discipline are your only allies in this eerie, high-stakes experience where hesitation can mean failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Room by room, threat by threat\u2014justice moves in silence.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3845440?t=1757942080","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3845440?t=1757942080","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845440/643fb0eacb39b4f793e34f8750c9549e4002feb0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757942080","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845440/643fb0eacb39b4f793e34f8750c9549e4002feb0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757942080","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the Shadows. Clear the Unknown.</strong><br>Immerse yourself in the boots of a SWAT officer tasked with clearing hostile environments where tension hangs as heavy as the silence. This VR tactical shooter plunges you into tight, atmospheric interiors where every room tells a story\u2014and hides a threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sweep rooms with precision, breach doors, detain suspects, and face unnerving encounters in dimly lit co